exports[`renderApiAsMarkdown > renders the groups of the API tab at the given depth and the entries below them 1`] = `
"### Components

#### KbqAlert (component)

Shows a message. Import \`KbqAlertModule\` or the component itself.

##### Usage

Put a title inside.

\`\`\`ts
@Component({ selector: 'kbq-alert' })
class KbqAlert {
    @Input() compact: boolean;
}
\`\`\`

- \`[compact]\`: \`boolean\` — Whether the alert is compact.

### Types

#### KbqAlertStyle (type)

Style.

\`\`\`ts
type KbqAlertStyle = 'error' | 'warning';
\`\`\`"
